COMMENT ON COLUMN risk_assessment.sequence_no IS '1 for the first scoring, then 2, 3 and so on [classification: Internal; personal data: no; protection: none]';
COMMENT ON COLUMN risk_assessment.rule_set_id IS 'Rule version used [classification: Internal; personal data: no; protection: none]';
COMMENT ON COLUMN risk_assessment.score IS 'Calculated score [classification: Internal; personal data: no; protection: none]';
COMMENT ON COLUMN risk_assessment.rating IS 'Rating derived from the score [classification: Internal; personal data: no; protection: none]';
COMMENT ON COLUMN risk_assessment.is_pep_applied IS 'True if the PEP points were applied, from declaration or screening [classification: Internal; personal data: no; protection: none]';
COMMENT ON COLUMN risk_assessment.assessed_at IS 'When it was scored [classification: Internal; personal data: no; protection: none]';
COMMENT ON TABLE case_decision IS 'Append-only history of every status change: who, when, action, old and new status and the mandatory note. The current decision is the latest row; nothing is overwritten. (classification: Confidential; retention: 5 years after the relationship ends; never edited or deleted (proposed, Q-011, NF-004))';
COMMENT ON COLUMN case_decision.id IS 'Surrogate identifier [classification: Internal; personal data: no; protection: none]';
COMMENT ON COLUMN case_decision.onboarding_case_id IS 'Case decided [classification: Internal; personal data: no; protection: none]';
COMMENT ON COLUMN case_decision.action IS 'What was decided [classification: Internal; personal data: no; protection: none]';
COMMENT ON COLUMN case_decision.old_status IS 'Status before [classification: Internal; personal data: no; protection: none]';
COMMENT ON COLUMN case_decision.new_status IS 'Status after [classification: Internal; personal data: no; protection: none]';
COMMENT ON COLUMN case_decision.actor_id IS 'Decider; the service rejects the case creator (BR-010) [classification: Internal; personal data: no; protection: none]';
COMMENT ON COLUMN case_decision.decided_at IS 'When it was decided [classification: Internal; personal data: no; protection: none]';
COMMENT ON COLUMN case_decision.note IS 'Decision note, mandatory [classification: Confidential; personal data: no; protection: none]';
COMMENT ON TABLE periodic_review IS 'A review of a customer that falls due after a decision, set from the rating (1, 2 or 3 years). Proposed (Q-004); could drive reminders later. (classification: Confidential; retention: 5 years after the customer relationship ends (proposed, Q-011); audited)';
COMMENT ON COLUMN periodic_review.id IS 'Surrogate identifier [classification: Internal; personal data: no; protection: none]';
COMMENT ON COLUMN periodic_review.customer_id IS 'Customer to review [classification: Internal; personal data: no; protection: none]';
COMMENT ON COLUMN periodic_review.source_case_id IS 'Case whose decision set this date [classification: Internal; personal data: no; protection: none]';
COMMENT ON COLUMN periodic_review.due_date IS 'When the review is due [classification: Internal; personal data: no; protection: none]';
COMMENT ON COLUMN periodic_review.status IS 'State of the review [classification: Internal; personal data: no; protection: none]';
COMMENT ON COLUMN periodic_review.completed_at IS 'When it was completed [classification: Internal; personal data: no; protection: none]';

